{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act8mini_level_act8mini_st05",
  "groupId": "act8mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "我无惧前路何往",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act8mini/level_act8mini_st05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2f50cbe5efd4fa14d96109bace08a9ffbed19b3dee14ac3a922e3308afa2fd08",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的说辞并不重要。于每刻践行自己的意志，才算是真正地活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去亲历这片大地吧。独属于你的思想，需要岁月来浇铸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凯尔希，我希望你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5:39 P.M. 天气/晴\n室外，罗德岛甲板"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近很忙吧，有许多需要处理的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "适当休息也是必要的，你的生理指标近期有一些小的波动，我会持续关注。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，煌会在今晚来向你作简报，她主导了昨天的突袭作战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1:23 A.M. 天气/雨\n巴别塔临时作战指挥室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "门外是Scout，他负责了昨夜的行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "这是他效力于巴别塔后少有的任务失败记录。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请进。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "指挥官，女士，你们都在。我简短说明一下昨晚的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小队清扫战场时，发现了可追踪的敌军痕迹。我判断这是摸清敌军位置的机会，执意循迹追击而中了埋伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "责任在我，我愿接受军事处分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这不是一个老萨卡兹雇佣兵会做出的决断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很可惜，那一刻我的经验并没有对我做出警示。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "经验不会被没发生的事唤醒。危机发生后，没有队员战死，说明撤退时你的指挥冷静、得当。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你应当得到表彰，而非处分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不明白这个结论是如何得出的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "军队的纪律若不能做到赏罚分明，则失去存在的意义。Scout，这个道理你一定明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为什么那样在乎她的名誉？我需要一个理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......凯尔希女士，瑞卡的情况怎么样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "她已经脱离了危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scout想开口说些什么，却欲言又止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的内心在斗争着。即使在战场上，也未见你如此为难过。若能说出你的考虑，或许我们可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我坚持不让瑞卡受到任何处分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为她是个孤儿？军队的纪律可承载不了泛滥的同情心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑞卡的父亲曾是萨卡兹雇佣兵，死于内战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这在卡兹戴尔不算什么新鲜事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑞卡的母亲身患严重的矿石病，没有抚养她的能力。特蕾西娅殿下知晓此事后，一直为她们家提供经济上的资助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这也没什么特别的。如果没有更充分的理由......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "瑞卡参军仅是为了报答殿下的恩情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她曾对我说，为殿下而战是她唯一的愿望，是她生命的全部......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请说下去，Scout，我在听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......在卡兹戴尔，孩子们难有什么愿望，也难有想守护的事物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们只是被卷入战争，而后战死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以你希望保留瑞卡的名誉，延续她守护殿下的愿望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scout没有回答，身经百战的老兵又回归了沉默。\n博士缓缓起身，伸手拍了拍Scout的肩膀。这是凯尔希没有预料到的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若刚才有任何冒犯，请原谅，我知道你一定会有很好的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的决定是，没有人会受到处分。但这样的处理结果是对军纪的损害，必定会招致非议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Scout，我希望你和你的小队在未来用行动回应质疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一定。指挥官，女士，我先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博士",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走之前答应我一件事。请至少把自己的生命和名誉，放在与其他队员同等的高度上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Scout",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_026",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......此外，可露希尔或许会找你商讨伦蒂尼姆的问题，她很关心我在这件事上的立场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以和她多分享一些决策过程，毕竟她也是潜在的作战成员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然，你们也可以......聊些别的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "11:27 A.M. 天气/晴\n罗德岛总工程师办公室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "这次又是什么事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "凯尔希，去伦蒂尼姆的事有定论了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "仍在讨论，行动本身确实存在风险。为什么突然关心这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "担心你心情不好呗。我清楚你心底一定想去，却要考虑罗德岛面临的危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "纠结的时候可是最消耗精力的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "不存在纠结，罗德岛的安全永远在首位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "如果哪天你能随心做想做的事该多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "这事可瞒不过我，凭你与特蕾西娅的友谊，伦蒂尼姆的事你无法置身事外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "与殿下无关。我只关心行动本身对罗德岛的利弊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "你就是这样，总把责任挂在嘴边，至少偶尔也该关心一下自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "麻烦的事丢给博士，咱俩去喝一杯倒倒苦水，多好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "博士已经很辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那倒也是，虽然博士失忆前后转变挺大，但工作狂这点可完全没变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "说起来，以前的博士可严肃了，还是现在这样比较好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "现在这样比较好欺负？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我听说了，你上次给博士试用的跑步机会无端浮空，必须观看商品促销广告才能降落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "那可是限时大促，是在帮博士省钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我需要你多为博士着想一些。没人想在忙得焦头烂额时再受一些惊吓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "好好好，怎么突然这么严肃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "可能是有点怵失忆前的博士吧，我现在总想搞点恶作剧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "尤其是最后那段日子里，博士的表现越来越古怪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "打住，可露希尔，相关话题到此为止。更禁止你对博士提起这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "放心吧，我有分寸。对了凯尔希，去伦蒂尼姆前，我准备开展对“待规划区”的整修，至少得对舰体材料进行加厚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "虽说是一笔很大的开销，但作为可靠的工程师，我认为这点程度的投资还是非常有必要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "所以啊，我已经代表工程部决定了，奋战三天三夜，让“待规划区”焕然一新！"
    },
