      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "咳咳，这我可就有发言权了。“待规划区”的正下方是无人机机库，而机库没有任何支柱的支撑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可露希尔",
      "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
      "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
      "text": "一旦上方遭到破坏，机库顶部就会变形，然后......"
