          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你是巴别塔的领袖，但同时也是矿石病患者。请重视自己的身体。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我建议你停止工作，立刻去休息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "凯尔希，你还是这么会关心人......啊，博士，请进来吧，我们没有在讨论机密事项。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我都听到了。殿下，你是该保证足够的睡眠时间。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "昨晚的作战会议气氛很微妙，想必消耗了你大量的精力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不必担心。倒是博士，我要为一些与会者的言辞道歉，他们无意冒犯，只是情绪稍有激动。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们担心我的安全，但我心里明白，博士一定考虑了所有可能的情况。这是最优解。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "特雷西斯想夺回战争的主动权。他深知你的优势同时也是你的软肋。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但他想不到的是，你会为萨卡兹人作出多大的牺牲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "当阿斯卡纶率领的部队出现在小镇上时，他将会意识到自己败局已定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你总是这么令人安心。博士，听你说话可比睡一觉让人精神多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "特蕾西娅疲惫的脸上展露出一丝欣慰的笑，这份笑容在她看向门外时变得更加温柔了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "快进来。来这边，坐我边上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "娇小的卡特斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可......可是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "别探头张望了，这里没有外人，阿米娅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，凯尔希医生，晚......晚上好。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不是故意这么晚还没休息的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "没人会责怪你。让我猜猜，做噩梦了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不......不是的。我是听到军队的集合声醒过来的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我趴在窗户上看，阿斯卡纶姐姐似乎带着其他战士在为远行做准备......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他们是有任务在身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是......可是阿斯卡纶姐姐说过，她绝对不会离开殿下和我哪怕一步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我担心发生了什么事，就想着偷偷来指挥室看一眼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿米娅呀阿米娅，是博士交给了阿斯卡纶一个小任务，他们不用多久就会回来的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你想想，博士指挥的战斗，哪一次不是速战速决？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "确......确实，如果是博士的意见，我就放心了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士是最能给人安全感的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "阿米娅，你该休息了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_051",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我这就回去！大家晚安。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "真是令人怜爱的孩子......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你来之前我确实在担心......阿斯卡纶离开期间罗德岛舰船的安全问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "担心是正常的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "博士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_048",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "拉长战线的同时，包围一个毫无战略意义的小镇。特雷西斯的真正目的无从得知。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我的安危倒是其次，更多的是担心连累到舰上的研究人员和孩子们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但正如阿米娅所说，你确实能给人带来安全感。在你指挥下所取得的战果也令人无从置疑。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "特蕾西娅",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_056",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，凯尔希，战争胜利的那天，应该不远了吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "刚才说的事，都是在你常规日程之外的......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你还在听吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我在听。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "听着呢，很清楚。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，怎样才算真正地活着？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这问题有些突然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......没想过。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这问题也太深刻了。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "服从他人意志，失去前行的理由，这算活着吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那不过是行尸走肉。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那是机器人吧？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "保有躯体，抽离记忆，又算活着吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那或许会活得有些茫然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这说的是我吧？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "若二者择其一，博士，你会如何抉择？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我选择成为人，而非傀儡。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我会选择自由。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "谁会想做机器？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "自由是有代价的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "失去记忆后醒来，被迫去战斗，被迫见证牺牲。一路走来我们并未给你太多选择......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......看着我的眼睛。告诉我，博士，你究竟为何而战？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我为反抗自己的命运而战。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我为罗德岛而战。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我为守护这片大地而战。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那请你不要忘记此刻的回答。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "即使没有人能理解，我们也必须要这样走下去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，而你也会找到你的道路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
